        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #7RB 24 Inch Traditional Door Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis pair (2 door handles) of traditional design 24\" door handles  from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of 1-1/2\" diameter Reed handle with large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors. Great for large entry doors when a lasting impression is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 7RB Traditional Door Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reed Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: The First Impressions 7RB door handles are handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 7 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n<br>\r\nAlso available: Individual <a href=\"/products/24-inch-traditional-door-handle-first-impressions-7rb\"><b>First Impressions 7RB</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Traditional Door Handles, Pair, First Impressions 7RB",
                "description": "Back to back pair of First Impressions 7RB Traditional design 24 inch door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of 1-1/2 inch diameter Reed handle with large ball finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry doors when a lasting impression is desired.",
                "keywords": "FII-7RB 24 Inch Traditional Door Handles, First Impressions #7 Large Reed Front Door Handles, FII-PR-7RB Large Ball and Reed Front Door Handles, First Impressions # 7 Decorative Door Pulls, Large Commercial Entry Door Handles, first impressions #7RB  Large Reed Entry Door Pulls, First Impressions 24 inch door handles, 2 foot door handles, First Impressions door pulls, decorative Large Door Pulls, glass door pulls,"
            },
